{\b Privacy.} Work to Unlock runs entirely on this PC. It records which approved application is in the foreground and for how long. It does not record keystrokes, window titles, document names or screenshots, and it does not send data anywhere.\par
\par
{\b Enforcement.} Restricted applications are closed by a background program running as you. This is best effort: an application may run briefly before it is closed. The optional strict enforcement service manages only its own AppLocker rules and removes them when it is uninstalled.\par
